<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Holland 흥미유형 검사 (학생용 24문항)</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f8;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #222;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 24px auto 40px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      padding: 24px 20px 32px;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .container { padding: 32px 40px 40px; }
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    p {
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 6px 0;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      background: #eef2ff;
      color: #3730a3;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .section {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ececf3;
    }
    .question-group-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0 4px;
    }
    .question {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }
    .question strong {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .options {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .options label {
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .options input[type="radio"] {
      accent-color: #4f46e5;
    }
    .scale-help {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: none;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #6366f1);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(79,70,229,0.25);
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.03);
    }
    .btn:active {
      transform: translateY(1px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(79,70,229,0.35);
    }
    .result {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 18px 16px 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f0f9ff;
      border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
      display: none;
    }
    .result h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .result-codes {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .scores-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 10px 0 12px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }
    .scores-table th,
    .scores-table td {
      border: 1px solid #d4d4d8;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .scores-table th {
      background: #f4f4ff;
    }
    .type-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      margin-right: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: #111827;
    }
    .type-R { background: #fee2e2; }
    .type-I { background: #dbeafe; }
    .type-A { background: #ffedd5; }
    .type-S { background: #dcfce7; }
    .type-E { background: #e0f2fe; }
    .type-C { background: #f3e8ff; }
    .note {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #555;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .footer-note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: #6b7280;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="badge">학생용 · Holland RIASEC 간이검사 (24문항)</div>
    <h1>Holland 흥미유형 검사</h1>
    <p>
      아래 문항을 읽고 <strong>나에게 얼마나 맞는지</strong> 1~5점으로 체크해 보세요.
      결과는 RIASEC 6가지 흥미유형 점수와 상위 유형 조합으로 표시됩니다.
    </p>
    <p class="scale-help">
      1점: 전혀 아니다 · 2점: 아니다 · 3점: 보통이다 · 4점: 그렇다 · 5점: 매우 그렇다
    </p>

    <div class="section" id="questions">
      <h2>문항</h2>

      <!-- R형 -->
      <div class="question">
        <strong>1. 손으로 만들기·조립하는 활동이 재미있다.</strong>
        <div class="options">
          <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="1">1</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="2">2</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="3">3</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="4">4</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="5">5</label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="question">
        <strong>2. 몸을 움직이는 활동을 좋아한다.</strong>
        <div class="options">
          <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="1">1</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="2">2</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="3">3</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="4">4</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="5">5</label>
